Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.10,0:00:06.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's a question that I've asked myself over and over.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.69,0:00:10.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,While I may proclaim to know who she is,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.61,0:00:17.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I may be missing something about Nagase Iori's true self on a fundamental level.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.11,0:00:22.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That question is "Who is Nagase Iori?"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.12,0:00:26.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This might be the worst time to do this,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.00,0:00:29.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I have to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.42,0:00:32.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.\NI {\i1}want{\i0} to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.17,0:00:39.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I really {\i1}do{\i0} love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.34,0:00:43.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So please, will you go out with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.15,0:00:53.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.\NI really am.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.28,0:00:59.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I think something just isn't right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.28,0:01:05.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So could you forget that I said I loved you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.41,0:01:09.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.29,0:01:12.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-Why, Nagase?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.50,0:01:14.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.67,0:01:17.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.72,0:01:18.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not the person Taichi thinks I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.01,0:01:21.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...gonna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.69,0:03:05.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,February 14th.\NValentine's Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.74,0:03:12.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An air of sweet excitement has permeated Yamaboshi High School.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.79,0:03:16.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But after being turned down by Nagase yesterday, the air in my mind is bitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.83,0:03:19.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yaegashi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.17,0:03:21.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why the long face?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.17,0:03:23.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You catch a cold or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.34,0:03:25.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You won't get any chocolate looking like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.85,0:03:33.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Frankly, this is a horrible time for me to be feeling depressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.77,0:03:39.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're in the middle of our fourth supernatural phenomenon, courtesy of Balloon Vine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.57,0:03:47.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Three days ago, Balloon Vine \Nappeared before us again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.53,0:03:49.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Emotion transmission.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.49,0:03:58.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Simply put, no matter where you are, whether you want them to know or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.62,0:03:58.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,your emotions will be transmitted to others.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.25,0:04:01.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So it's like a form of telepathy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.50,0:04:07.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You could say that, but not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.55,0:04:11.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The phenomenon's timing will be completely random.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.01,0:04:13.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That includes whose emotions are transmitted, and to whom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.47,0:04:13.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those will change each time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.27,0:04:16.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.43,0:04:21.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.85,0:04:23.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was like Taichi's thoughts \Nsuddenly echoed in my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.52,0:04:23.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that how this works?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.78,0:04:30.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.\NThe person whose heart was\Nprobed will know who received them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.82,0:04:38.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But those on the receiving side will not know who else received them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.04,0:04:38.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.21,0:04:46.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I knew that my thoughts were transmitted to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.42,0:04:46.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah.\NWell, that's all for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.26,0:04:50.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.26,0:04:53.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you have any questions, I can answer them now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.84,0:04:53.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That {\i1}thing{\i0} from last time, The Second—what the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.68,0:04:58.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.68,0:05:02.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They've taken an interest in me.{should this be "me" or "you"?}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.56,0:05:02.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In other words, I'm becoming more interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.90,0:05:09.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I don't really need to tell you about that, do I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.78,0:05:11.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I've explained the situation to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.82,0:05:11.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Until next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.16,0:05:19.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This isn't our first time dealing with him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.58,0:05:22.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we live our lives as we normally do, they'll leave us alone soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.96,0:05:25.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.33,0:05:29.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They just want to watch us because they think we're interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.05,0:05:33.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They'll stop all of this once they lose interest in us, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.67,0:05:33.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.39,0:05:34.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll be able to get through this one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.64,0:05:38.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you think so, too, Nagase?\NOh, uh... Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.27,0:05:44.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.10,0:05:49.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll {\i1}pulverize{\i0} Balloon Vine's plans and make it so they'll never screw with us again!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.98,0:05:51.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm getting fired up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.49,0:05:53.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've made it this far!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.70,0:05:54.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll be fine this time, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.74,0:05:56.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.74,0:05:59.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You {\i1}do{\i0} know you're the weakest link, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.58,0:05:59.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?\NCome on, Inaba-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.58,0:06:08.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's been three days since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.67,0:06:08.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We may be in the middle of this emotion transmission phenomenon,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.21,0:06:15.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I don't want that to influence the decisions I make,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.34,0:06:15.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,which is precisely why I asked Nagase to go out with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.14,0:06:22.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So could you forget that I said I loved you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.56,0:06:26.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could I have a word with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.53,0:06:32.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yaegashi-kun, you're having love troubles, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.24,0:06:38.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Today is Valentine's Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.16,0:06:39.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The biggest day for love in the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.16,0:06:45.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't have you bringing everyone down when they're practically walking on air.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.21,0:06:45.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.12,0:06:48.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.12,0:06:49.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did Nagase-san reject you or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.17,0:06:51.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, she did?\NYou looked like you were getting along just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.26,0:06:59.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So she did...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.39,0:07:03.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I appreciate the sympathy, but you don't need to get depressed, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.56,0:07:03.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a {\i1}twist{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.64,0:07:04.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is my chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.64,0:07:09.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?!\NOh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.64,0:07:12.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was so happy that I couldn't control myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.19,0:07:16.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You still haven't given up on Nagase?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.57,0:07:16.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just to set it straight,\NI was only turned down!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.57,0:07:19.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You haven't won yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.57,0:07:19.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.83,0:07:21.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Keep crying, {\i1}loser{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.04,0:07:26.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You bitch...\NI mean, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.04,0:07:29.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You two were so {\i1}lovey-dovey{\i0}, and she {\i1}rejected{\i0} you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.79,0:07:33.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's hilarious!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.79,0:07:34.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Were you always like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.17,0:07:35.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're looking better already.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.88,0:07:38.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Using face muscles you don't normally use is exhausting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.10,0:07:43.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.18,0:07:46.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to cheer me up?\NSo {\i1}this{\i0} is what they call a lucky break.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.02,0:07:49.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm still laughing inside.\NSo you really {\i1}were{\i0} just laughing at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.61,0:07:53.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Try to cheer up, Yaegashi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.61,0:07:56.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no point in moping around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.82,0:07:56.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a good opportunity for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.32,0:07:59.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why not try asking Inaba-san out?\NWait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.32,0:08:03.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How do you know about me and Inaba?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.99,0:08:06.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It couldn't be more obvious that she's in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.29,0:08:06.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It may have gone unnoticed to most, but not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.62,0:08:11.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.62,0:08:14.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Class 1-3's Love God!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.67,0:08:17.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hope you know that I fear you, Love God.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.05,0:08:20.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now when should I give him my chocolate?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.43,0:08:21.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inaba...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.43,0:08:24.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.80,0:08:24.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.35,0:08:29.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, like I was saying, why not ask\NInaba-san out once you cheer up?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.60,0:08:35.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And while you're off working your magic on her, I'll take Nagase-san for myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.49,0:08:40.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I figured that was what you were after.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.54,0:08:53.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Taichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.59,0:08:55.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're finally here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.59,0:08:59.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've got a problem on our hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.76,0:08:59.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?\NDid Balloon Vine do something?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.22,0:09:03.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No!\NIt's Gossan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.72,0:09:06.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He might have to quit being our moderator!\NO-Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.56,0:09:10.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.60,0:09:15.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gossan's the moderator for both our club and the jazz band right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.15,0:09:21.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But next year, it's his turn to do something administrative.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.57,0:09:21.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He'll be busy, so he'll only be\Nable to moderate one club.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.86,0:09:26.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Yeah, sure, change our moderator.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.37,0:09:29.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fine by me," is what I'd like to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.37,0:09:32.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but there's Balloon Vine to consider.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.71,0:09:38.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Honestly, we couldn't ask for anyone better than Gotou since he doesn't come around here at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.88,0:09:41.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It'll be a problem if we get a serious teacher who actually checks on us every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.72,0:09:46.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyway, to get to the point,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.72,0:09:49.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,whichever club earns more points at the end-of-year club presentations gets to keep Gotou.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.81,0:09:54.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The club presentations?\NOh, right. We have to do those, don't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.56,0:10:00.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, how about we raid the jazz band's practice right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.78,0:10:03.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Iori-chan, you're a genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.24,0:10:07.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I definitely want to know what Gossan does over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.49,0:10:07.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.\NReconnaissance is a basic part of war!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.38,0:10:20.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.38,0:10:25.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The jazz band has a good reason for wanting to keep Gotou-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.26,0:10:27.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just wow, Gossan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.60,0:10:29.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is unreal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.43,0:10:32.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you were in the jazz band, Shiroyama-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.93,0:10:36.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'm nowhere near the level of the other members, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.52,0:10:40.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shiroyama-kun, don't be so modest!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.77,0:10:42.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're the best player out of all the first-year members!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.78,0:10:42.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.99,0:10:46.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shiroyama-kun's pretty popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.91,0:10:50.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see why they call him "The Prince."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.04,0:10:56.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They said some pro bands want him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.37,0:10:56.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You really can't judge a book by its cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.79,0:11:03.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Taking down that jazz band's going to be tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.67,0:11:03.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.55,0:11:11.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, so we've been tossed into a \Nbattle which we simply {\i1}mustn't{\i0} lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.89,0:11:15.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, today is February 14th!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.97,0:11:15.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you think there's something even more important that we should be thinking about, gentlemen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.65,0:11:19.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.65,0:11:22.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't anyone with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.44,0:11:25.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're in the middle of this emotion transmission thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.99,0:11:27.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't need to bring up a topic like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.82,0:11:30.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Exactly my point!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.45,0:11:35.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We should tell each other now, before \Neveryone finds out at the most awkward time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.50,0:11:38.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.33,0:11:41.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just {\i1}have{\i0} to know who you're giving yours to, Inaba.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.46,0:11:45.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've been dying to know ever since you asked me how to make chocolate a few days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.96,0:11:45.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seriously?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.96,0:11:48.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inaba-chan, there's a guy you're into?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.26,0:11:50.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.93,0:11:55.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You expect me to tell everyone that I love Taichi at a time like {\i0}this{\i1}?!{aww shit}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.69,0:12:00.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.69,0:12:03.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did a transmission happen just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.94,0:12:03.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.99,0:12:07.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought there might be something\Nbetween you two, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.95,0:12:10.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,D-Don't worry about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.99,0:12:16.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I knew I needed to tell you guys eventually, but I couldn't decide on a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.29,0:12:20.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.29,0:12:24.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Iori and I are going head-to-head in seducing Taichi.{Team Inaba reporting in!}{yeah, fuk iori}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.00,0:12:24.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Funny, right? You could bust your gut!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.96,0:12:27.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inaba-chan and Iori-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.88,0:12:29.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,over Taichi?{Taichi looks so happy}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.26,0:12:33.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.26,0:12:35.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not going to turn into anything messy!\NRight, Iori? Taichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.77,0:12:41.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, it'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.77,0:12:44.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Though, I probably shouldn't say that...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.44,0:12:46.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...since I confessed to and got turned down by Nagase yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.53,0:12:47.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Flat out rejected.{I CANT KEEP WATCHING}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.28,0:12:49.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.16,0:12:51.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.16,0:12:54.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You all got that one, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.91,0:12:56.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Iori, he asked you out and you...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.62,0:12:58.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...turned him down?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.62,0:13:01.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.62,0:13:03.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then what about my feelings?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.08,0:13:03.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.05,0:13:08.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry.{Taichi, u dun goofed}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.05,0:13:11.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Sorry"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.01,0:13:18.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Explain yourself, Iori!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.01,0:13:21.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why the hell did you turn him down?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.81,0:13:21.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, Inaban, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.77,0:13:28.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I turned him down, but I have my reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.32,0:13:33.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was going to tell you later, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.24,0:13:33.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's none of her business.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.24,0:13:35.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why's she snapping at me?{uh oooh}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.04,0:13:40.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.79,0:13:42.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Was that Iori?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.79,0:13:45.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I didn't mean that, Inaban!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.96,0:13:45.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to make it\Nsound like it's your problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.80,0:13:49.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What I meant was—\N{\i1}You're getting depressed when{\i0} you're{\i1} the one who snapped at {\i0}me{\i1}? Selfish much?{yeeeeeessssss}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.80,0:13:58.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not what I meant either. It was a joke.\NI guess I can't just brush it off like that, can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.60,0:14:02.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Completely different from what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.10,0:14:07.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, I didn't—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.61,0:14:09.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Iori's scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.36,0:14:10.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Was Iori-chan always this kind of person?{IT KEEPS HAPPENING HAHAHA}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.90,0:14:12.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.95,0:14:18.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't mean that, Iori!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.74,0:14:18.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.25,0:14:22.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did Iori-chan get something from you, Inaba-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.84,0:14:35.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And so, Nagase Iori broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.07,0:14:42.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.61,0:14:47.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Onii-chan!\NHow was your day?\NGet any chocolate?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.20,0:14:51.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Onii-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.50,0:14:54.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you didn't even get a single piece!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.75,0:14:58.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Some people gave me a few out of obligation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.88,0:15:02.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, you'll be fine then.\NWait, I know what's wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.05,0:15:05.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You didn't get any chocolate from the girl you like!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.01,0:15:10.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You probably saw her giving\Nsome to some other guy, too!{oh wow this ho is cruel}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.35,0:15:11.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry. I'll talk to you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.97,0:15:15.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait! Seriously, tell me what's wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.27,0:15:18.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look, I have some chocolate for you, so cheer up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.52,0:15:21.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is my true love chocolate!{:)}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.57,0:15:25.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.49,0:15:31.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Aren't you gonna tell me what's wrong? Onii-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.13,0:15:41.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Morning, Iori!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.13,0:15:43.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, Nakayama-chan, morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.80,0:15:46.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, did you give anyone chocolate yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.47,0:15:51.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I {\i1}did{\i0} give some to a few people who I'm always causing trouble for, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.35,0:15:54.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I mean chocolate for someone you like!\NYou're really popular, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.73,0:15:56.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't there someone you have your eye on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.48,0:15:59.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The only one I have eyes for, Mariko...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.77,0:16:03.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.19,0:16:06.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh my, Iori! I'm flattered!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.57,0:16:08.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What were you trying to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.57,0:16:13.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no deeper meaning to it.\NHe asked me out, and I rejected him. It's as simple as that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.70,0:16:17.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did something happen to make you fall out of love with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.25,0:16:20.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why are you even bugging me about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.92,0:16:22.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because I'm not convinced.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.80,0:16:24.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not convinced about what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.71,0:16:29.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Inaban.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.71,0:16:35.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You might not understand, but I really don't want to go out with Taichi anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.64,0:16:40.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So...\Nyou really don't have to mind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.90,0:16:45.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Does it have anything to do with this emotion transmission thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.24,0:16:49.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I can't say it has {\i1}nothing{\i0} to do with it...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.20,0:16:51.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then rethink your decision!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.66,0:16:55.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're in a weird situation right now.\NOur decision-making is impaired.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.62,0:16:57.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait until we're back to normal, then—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.25,0:16:59.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When will that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.83,0:17:02.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure, this phenomenon will end eventually,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.04,0:17:05.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but what if another one occurs?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.05,0:17:07.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.51,0:17:10.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,People are influenced by their experiences.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.84,0:17:15.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's so different about Balloon Vine's\Nphenomena and other external influences?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.89,0:17:21.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This whole thing with Taichi and me wouldn't have started if we never experienced personality switching.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.98,0:17:24.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Was our decision-making impaired then, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.77,0:17:27.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you {\i1}really{\i0} want Taichi and me to start dating, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.03,0:17:29.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.87,0:17:35.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.28,0:17:36.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nagase said that...\N{\i1}And then there's Inaba...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.87,0:17:41.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you get those too, Inaban?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.75,0:17:43.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.29,0:17:47.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll be late for school.\NLet's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.60,0:17:58.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What was wrong with me just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.07,0:18:11.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sorry I'm a day late.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.90,0:18:15.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Holy crap, I'm so happy that I could die!{that's good for him :)}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.05,0:18:29.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inaba.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.76,0:18:34.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry to call you out like this.\NI wanted to apologize for what happened yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.34,0:18:38.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't need to apologize.\NAll of that was my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.64,0:18:41.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I was just kind of surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.43,0:18:47.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought you would've said something to me before asking Iori out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.27,0:18:48.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.57,0:18:50.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.57,0:18:53.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I talked to Inaba, and she stopped me,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.65,0:18:53.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wouldn't have been able to go through with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.03,0:19:01.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You...\NYou had trouble deciding between Iori and me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.33,0:19:02.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-No, you're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.16,0:19:04.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am?{Holy fuck, this line and this expression.}{hnng}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.38,0:19:08.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,W-Well, you're not wrong, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.59,0:19:16.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I love Nagase.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.59,0:19:19.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But that doesn't mean I don't like you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.06,0:19:23.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've never met someone as amazing as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.18,0:19:26.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,R-Really? You said that pretty confidently.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.69,0:19:31.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I mean, you're really smart,\Nand you're always thinking about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.19,0:19:32.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And you're actually really nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.03,0:19:37.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're mature, beautiful,\Nand kind of cute on top of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.20,0:19:40.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You might not be very athletic or good at cooking,\Nbut the rest of you more than makes up for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.12,0:19:43.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,W-Wait! Give me a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.08,0:19:49.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay. Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.67,0:19:53.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? I don't really need to, do I?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.17,0:19:55.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come {\i1}on{\i0}! What else?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.13,0:19:56.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.13,0:19:58.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No! Forget what I just said.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.68,0:20:01.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That came out wrong.\NI just got tongue-tied!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.14,0:20:06.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.06,0:20:11.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here. It's a day late, but take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.61,0:20:14.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O-Oh. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.86,0:20:19.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're still in love with Iori, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.45,0:20:20.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.70,0:20:25.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you feel obligated to go out with me after getting rejected?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.41,0:20:27.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No. That's just low.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.12,0:20:31.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whether it's low or not is up for debate, in my opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.04,0:20:37.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know what I should do either.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.38,0:20:39.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My thoughts are a total train wreck.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.47,0:20:42.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.72,0:20:45.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What I {\i1}do{\i0} know is that I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.06,0:20:49.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Got it. You can look forward to White Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.81,0:20:52.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.48,0:20:55.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the heck?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.32,0:20:58.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yui, you gave Taichi the same chocolate that you gave me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.74,0:21:01.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-It was close!\NIt was close, so I couldn't give closure!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.62,0:21:04.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by "closure"?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.53,0:21:07.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't let that slide.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.04,0:21:12.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even though I seriously, absolutely, and without a doubt don't give a {\i1}damn{\i0} about Aoki.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.79,0:21:15.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You didn't need to emphasize it that heavily!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.30,0:21:17.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,T-Taichi's done a lot for me this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.96,0:21:20.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was just being nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.72,0:21:22.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no special meaning behind it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.26,0:21:23.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you {\i1}sure{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.10,0:21:28.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes!\NI don't l-love him like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.18,0:21:30.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Though I absolutely love him as a friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.27,0:21:32.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Absolutely," huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.19,0:21:33.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I told you, there's no special meaning behind it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.06,0:21:38.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You must really love Taichi a lot, Inaba-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.90,0:21:41.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.32,0:21:43.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Got a problem with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.74,0:21:46.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No! No problem at all, Captain Inaba!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.54,0:21:50.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyway, Yui getting over her fear of men really {\i1}was{\i0} a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.00,0:21:54.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She was able to give obligatory chocolates to all the guys in her class yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.88,0:22:00.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.13,0:22:03.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She even thought that some of the guys at the dojo were handsome and had nice stances.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.63,0:22:06.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you {\i1}have{\i0} to say that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.63,0:22:07.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?! That's a {\i1}huge{\i0} problem for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.39,0:22:09.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should start going to that dojo, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.86,0:22:20.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's discuss what we'll be doing for our presentation.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.11,0:22:23.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How will we outdo the jazz band?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.61,0:22:25.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's start with some brainstorming.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.54,0:22:34.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.71,0:22:36.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The girls should cosplay as something sexy
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.09,0:22:40.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to melt the brains of any male teachers and the guys on the student council—
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.46,0:22:45.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll give your suggestion some thought if you can draw my sympathy by stripping naked and dancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.30,0:22:53.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How about presenting the most popular \Narticles from past issues of the CRC News?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.35,0:22:57.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But we won't be able to\Nbeat the jazz band like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.73,0:23:01.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. They're going to perform\Nin front of the judges.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.65,0:23:03.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That'll leave one hell of an impression.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.45,0:23:09.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why don't we make something major\Nspecifically for the presentations?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.20,0:23:13.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll appeal to those stupid teachers
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.20,0:23:18.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,with that "Effort is more important than \Nachievement" crap that they love so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.50,0:23:24.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those teachers would be heartbroken if they found out how crooked our efforts are.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.17,0:23:27.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The gap between your outer appearance and the darkness in your heart is too deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.80,0:23:31.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't mean it like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.85,0:23:34.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.85,0:23:36.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How about running a special about the best places around school?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.60,0:23:40.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It'll take time to do the research, and we can publish it as a CRC News Extra.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.07,0:23:44.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.07,0:23:46.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Making something that really feels student-made should leave a good impression on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.07,0:23:51.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And it'll be useful information for everyone.\NI think it's a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.70,0:23:55.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right! We'll split up and start researching tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.12,0:24:00.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll find interesting places around here and compile them into articles by the presentation date.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.17,0:24:03.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sound good to you, President?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.21,0:24:05.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.72,0:24:10.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Iori?\NYou're totally not your normal self today!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.26,0:24:12.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do I have to be my normal self?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.89,0:24:19.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I knew it.\NI can't stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.19,0:24:23.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They already have their own ideas about who "Nagase Iori" is.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.32,0:24:25.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-Iori-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.94,0:24:27.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't mind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.11,0:24:30.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll go home first.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.58,0:24:41.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,W-Wait, Iori-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.09,0:24:52.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-Iori-chan, why are you trying to do the whole "cool beauty" thing now?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.14,0:24:57.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Trying to make a statement about how \NInaba-chan's given up on being the cool one?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.94,0:25:06.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What just happened, Aoki?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.32,0:25:09.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Were Iori's emotions transmitted to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.49,0:25:15.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought that the best thing I could do was just be myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.37,0:25:21.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I did, then Yui and everyone else could go back to being themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.83,0:25:24.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But that didn't accomplish anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.13,0:25:26.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello, Aoki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.30,0:25:33.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't think I've ever called you "Aoki-san" before.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.51,0:25:36.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.47,0:25:40.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aoki-san, what do you think of this phenomenon?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.77,0:25:42.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's absolutely awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.81,0:25:44.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.77,0:25:47.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, what do you think you can do about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.15,0:25:51.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can just be myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.95,0:25:55.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't that the same as not doing anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.37,0:25:58.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-No, there's meaning in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.24,0:26:00.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah. That wasn't quite right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.75,0:26:05.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not that you're not doing anything,\Nit's that you can't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.88,0:26:09.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're the most useless of the five.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.38,0:26:12.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me ask you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.01,0:26:14.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you think you can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.43,0:26:21.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't do anything, Aoki-san.\NWhat are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.14,0:26:24.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wonder what Aoki's doing right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.69,0:26:26.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yui!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.19,0:26:32.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If Yui's thinking about me, I can fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.57,0:26:35.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can fight harder than anyone ever has!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.49,0:26:40.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll just be myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.71,0:26:47.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For me, for Yui, and for everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.84,0:26:50.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will do everything I can\Nfor the club presentations.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.84,0:26:55.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You really are the most useless of the five.\NYou're not interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.34,0:26:57.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then just leave us all alone already!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.56,0:27:02.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well...\NThat's all I had to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.85,0:27:06.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe this will be the last\Ntime I talk to you, Aoki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.56,0:27:07.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.90,0:27:16.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't you dare patronize us!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.90,0:27:18.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The CRC won't move an inch from something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.96,0:27:27.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who asks me out and who I turn down is none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.54,0:27:29.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But would you really be okay with that, Inaba?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.63,0:27:31.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're not the Iori we knew!\NBitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.67,0:27:34.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should just disband the Cultural Research Club.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.59,0:27:36.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You probably think I'm a liar.
